            "logo_5": "shopify://shop_images/full_505d85e7-8156-4410-a027-c4bc1b4ad9fc.png",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Enjoy the convenience and installment offerings of our partner online payment portals! Simply select the payment portal of your choice below the \"Proceed to Checkout\" option, and choose your installment plan.</p><p>View our comparison chart here to discover which financing option is best for you.</p><p>Explore comprehensive financing options for your commercial gym or fitness facility through Geneva Capital. Learn more about their terms and conditions here.</p><p>View our comparison chart here to discover which financing option is best for you.</p><ol><li>Geneva Capital is only available for businesses, thus requiring a separate financing application process directly through their Sales Manager. The other options mentioned above are available upon online checkout.</li></ol>"
